OL,3,GNEWSAFallen trees cause rail disruption
OL,4,Aand power cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FFallen trees have caused power cuts and
OL,7,Fsevere disruption to rail services,
OL,8,Fwith people advised to avoid travelling
OL,9,Fby train in parts of the East of
OL,10,FEngland until Sunday.
OL,12,FGreater Anglia said services had been
OL,13,Fcancelled between Manningtree and
OL,14,FHarwich Town, Manningtree and Ipswich,
OL,15,Fand Bishop's Stortford and Stansted
OL,16,FAirport.
OL,18,FIt added the strong winds on Friday
OL,19,Fnight also meant only diesel trains
OL,20,Fwould be able to run between Ipswich
OL,21,Fand Colchester, severely limiting
OL,22,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
