OL,3,GNEWSAFallen trees cause rail disruption
OL,4,Aand power cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 2,500 properties around Bury St
OL,7,FEdmunds in Suffolk were left without
OL,8,Felectricity after a fault on a
OL,9,Fhigh-voltage line, but UK Power
OL,10,FNetworks said most had been reconnected
OL,11,Fovernight.
